OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright to start, before showers
OL,6,Fspread eastwards with some heavier
OL,7,Fbursts possible. These becoming
OL,8,Fconfined to the west into the
OL,9,Fafternoon, allowing for sunny spells
OL,10,Fto develop. Breezy initially, winds
OL,11,Feasing later. Feeling fresher, though
OL,12,Ftemperatures a little above average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA few isolated showers around
OL,15,Fto start tonight further west.
OL,16,FElsewhere remaining dry with clear
OL,17,Fskies. Winds turn increasingly light.
OL,18,FA cooler night than the last.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
