OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with showery
OL,6,Foutbreaks further north and west to
OL,7,Fstart on Wednesday, becoming drier by
OL,8,Fmidday with long sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in that
OL,10,Fsunshine with light southwesterly
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,14,FTurning more settled, largely dry with
OL,15,Fsunny spells by day. Nights become
OL,16,Fmisty under lighter winds, with fog
OL,17,Fperhaps lingering into the following
OL,18,Fmorning. Rain arriving later on
OL,19,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
